# NextCart — Frontend Environment Variables
#
# See https://nextjs.org/docs/basic-features/environment-variables for more info.
#
# NOTE:
#   - Never commit actual .env values to the repository — .env* files are
#     gitignored (see .gitignore line 34). This file is documentation only.
#   - Override NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL for production deployments.
#   - The development default http://localhost:8080 is used when the variable
#     is not set (api.ts resolveBaseUrl() fallback).

# API Configuration
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080
